# GldeTK scene. Shared by the renderer (GPU) and the physics (CPU), F5 reloads it.
#
# The language is described in README.md (Scene language), scenes/showcase.scene shows every
# primitive and operation (sphere, box, torus, cone, capsule, ... translate, rotate, repeat,
# twist, bend, round, onion, subtract, smooth, ...).
# Separate arguments are space-delimited, so wrap arithmetic in parentheses: sphere (1 + 0.2 * sin(t))

plane (0, 1, 0) 0

repeat (10, 10 + sin(t), 10) {
    sphere 1 color (1, 0.55, 0.45)
}

repeat (7, 0, 9) {
    box (1, 2, 1)
}

repeat (12, 0, 13) {
    cylinder 1 30 color (0.6, 0.8, 1)
}
